 <!-- ORASOLU PURPOSE -->
 <section class="section">
 <div class="container">

 <div class="about-purpose">

 <div>
 <div class="eyebrow">WHY ORASOLU</div>

 <h2>
 Built from real technology work.
 </h2>
 </div>

 <div>
 <p>
 Database problems rarely exist in isolation. Performance depends
 on workload and infrastructure. High availability depends on
 architecture and operations. Migrations depend on both technology
 and execution.
 </p>

 <p>
 ORASOLU documents that engineering context through articles,
 scripts, diagnostics, tools, experiments and technical notes.
 </p>

 <p>
 The goal is not simply to collect information. It is to turn
 experience into knowledge that can be understood, reused and applied.
 </p>
 </div>

